url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅\r\n\r\nOh hi there! 😄\r\n\r\nTo expedite issue processing please search open and closed issues before submitting a new one.\r\nExisting issues often contain information about workarounds, resolution, or progress updates.\r\n\r\n🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅🔅-->\r\n\r\n# 📚 Docs or angular.io bug report\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWe currently list the Java SDK as a [prerequisite](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/docs/DEVELOPER.md#prerequisite-software) in the [Developer Guide](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/docs/DEVELOPER.md). \r\n\r\nWe link to the Oracle JDK site in Spanish (http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/es/java/javase/downloads/index.html).\r\n\r\n1. It seems like an English site should be the default (http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/downloads/index.html)\r\n2. The English site lists Oracle JDK 11.0.2 (LTS) as the top recommendation.\r\n\r\nDoes Selenium, Bazel, and everything else work with Java 11?\r\nDoes it work with the Open JDK 11?\r\n\r\nShould we be pointing people at the [Open JDK](https://jdk.java.net/11/) now as the Oracle JDK’s [Oracle Commercial only license](https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/terms/license/javase-license.html) will likely scare away contributors (and possibly even team’s considering Angular)?\r\n\r\nThe Open JDK uses a [GPL v2 license with the Classpath Exception](https://openjdk.java.net/legal/gplv2+ce.html).\r\n\r\nOr do we need to specify Java SDK 8?\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\n\r\n### What's the affected URL?**\r\nhttps://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/docs/DEVELOPER.md#prerequisite-software\r\n\r\n### Reproduction Steps**\r\nClick the link for the \"Java Development Kit\".\r\n\r\n### Expected vs Actual Behavior**\r\nIt opens the [Oracle JDK site](http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/es/java/javase/downloads/index.html) in Spanish. It should open an English site by default and we should consider the Open JDK or specify Java SDK 8.\r\n\r\n## 📷Screenshot\r\n![screen shot 2019-02-28 at 18 20 03](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3506071/53605431-7f10b000-3b85-11e9-9239-4d823e089332.png)\r\n![screen shot 2019-02-28 at 18 19 46](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3506071/53605435-81730a00-3b85-11e9-8940-8d9bb5385dd8.png)\r\n\r\n## 🌍  Your Environment\r\n\r\n### Browser info\r\nChrome 72.0.3626.109 (Official Build) (64-bit)\r\n\r\n### Anything else relevant?\r\n<!-- ✍️Please provide additional info if necessary. -->\r\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"zarend","id":7720245,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAyNDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7720245?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend","html_url":"https://github.com/zarend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/29043/reactions","total_count":2,"+1"